    badge: "Core Web Vitals & Scale",
    companyUrl: "https://www.scube.co/",
    description: "Spearheaded frontend development for Breeze SaaS using Next.js (SSR/SSG hybrid) and TypeScript. Architected decoupled GraphQL queries querying headless Sanity CMS content. Audited Core Web Vitals to slash First Contentful Paint by 50% and dramatically boost client retention.",
    metrics: ["50% Speed Acceleration", "GraphQL & Sanity CMS", "Hybrid SSR/SSG Engine", "Core Web Vitals Optimization"],
